# Conflict fixture: the same pattern appears twice with different owners.
# The second occurrence (later in the file) wins.
#
# Pattern precedence (GitHub semantics): LAST matching rule wins.
#
# For any file `src/**`:
#   1. `src/**`       matches → owners: @legacy-team          (overridden)
#   2. `src/**`       matches → owners: @current-team         ← WINS
#
# This scenario arises when a CODEOWNERS file is updated in a PR and the
# author appends a new rule without removing the old one.

src/**            @legacy-team
# Ownership transferred in PR #42 — supersedes the rule above
src/**            @current-team
